		{
			"outputs":[
				
			],
			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"TeaCache could be considered to be sort of an automated step skipper \n\nThe relative l1 threshold -value determines how aggressive this is, higher values are faster but quality suffers more. Very first steps should NEVER be skipped with this model or it kills the motion. When using the pre-calculated coefficients, the treshold value should be much higher than with the default coefficients.\n\nTeaCache 可以被视为一种自动跳过步骤的机制。\n\n其中的 相对 L1 阈值（relative l1 threshold） 决定了跳过的激进程度，值越高，运行越快，但画质损失也越严重。\n这个模型在最开始的几个步骤绝对不能跳过，否则会导致运动效果完全丧失。\n如果你使用的是预计算的系数（pre-calculated coefficients），那么阈值应当设置得比默认系数下更高。"
			],
			"inputs":[
				
			],
			"flags":{
				
			},
			"type":"Note",
			"mode":0,
			"bgcolor":"#653",
			"size":[
